+Until 2026-08-25 the check measured everything against the *comment* distribution, so the
+first post it saw came back "longer than 99%" against a population it does not belong to —
+a wrong number wearing the authority of a measurement.
+
+The pricing cannot see a **specimen**: a first-person demonstration, the thing going wrong
+in the comment that reports it, is the most checkable evidence a reply can carry and counts
+as zero anchors.
