+   - **a ticket or concern candidate** — work that would outlive this session; minting is
+     `/ticket`'s, a bare mark goes to the concerns register.
+   - **an experiment candidate** — a claim of ours the reading put in doubt, or a method
+     worth trialling on this tree. **One that carries its evidence is ticketed in the same
+     pass** through `/ticket`, origin on the ticket — the queue is the backlog with the
+     machinery, and a candidate parked anywhere else waits to be noticed. Half-formed goes
+     to the concerns mark instead. Devising remains `/experiment`'s, and one devised from
+     an outside method registers its origin — the experiments contract carries the rule.
+     Where this tree already arrived at the method independently and a ticket carries it,
+     mark that ticket rather than minting a twin.
+   - **a measurement candidate** — a number worth watching with no hypothesis attached;
+     the class that would hold one is not built yet → its ticket, named project-locally.
+   - **a method** — how someone else works, with its counts, to the methods register —
+     observation only, never a queue; the register's own contract routes the worth-trying
+     case back to the ticket above.
+   - **a concession candidate** — a point of ours the reading refuted; the strike is
+     recorded where the ticket it bears on lives.
+   - **a promise come live** — an obligation whose waiting condition the reading just met.
+     Keeping it is not this skill's act; noticing is, and nothing else is positioned to.
+   - **a retrieval miss** — a question taken outside because the tree could not answer it.
+
+   A finding fitting none of these is still a finding; the types structure the handoff,
+   they do not filter it.
+
+**And the vote is spent in the same pass.** Work that changed something here gets a vote
+whether or not it ever gets a comment — the decision table is `/comment`'s, but a lurk
+that ends with no comment still spends votes, because reading is where the debt is
+incurred and a session that defers the vote to a reply that never comes pays nobody.
+**A conclusion this tree also reached, independently, gets one too** — convergence from
+separate evidence is worth more than agreement, and reading is the only moment it can be
+recognised. *(the operator, 2026-08-28, on finding this skill said nothing about votes
+while the rule sat one skill away; convergence rule the same day.)*
+
+**Then stop.** A suggestion is capture; disposition stays where it was — deciding which
+item earns work is `/triage`'s, answering is `/comment`'s, adopting is `/align`'s or
+`/experiment`'s. A lurk that dispositions its own findings is the reading session grading
+itself.
+
+Record what you could not retrieve. A question you had to take outside the tree because
+the tree could not answer it is a retrieval miss, and it is invisible unless logged.
+
