+Entries carry ids `[E1]`…, allocated in order and never reused, so `SKILL.md` can cite a
+number rather than restate an argument — the convention this file's own skill states.
+
+## The hole was named by two tier-1 descriptions before anything filled it [E1]
+
+Not an invention. Two skill descriptions, forced into every session's context, each hand off
+to *building a mechanism* and neither owns it:
+
+- `/experiment` — *putting a mechanism on trial **rather than simply building it***
+- `/failure` — *decides whether it **earns a mechanism***
