+work until requested."* A statement in the graveyard, removed from one of its two homes and
+alive in the other for three days — which is the same defect this skill's *derive the reach*
+rule exists to prevent, sitting inside the file that should have carried the rule.
+
+**Kept anyway, at the operator's direction**, along with `/sync-arch`: both become useful
+against a real codebase, and this corpus is not one. Repairing them into corpus skills would
+have destroyed two working artifacts to avoid writing one file.
