+---
+name: remember
+description: >-
+  Write to the tree, governed by accumulated retrieval misses rather than by the
+  ending session's sense of importance. Use when concluding a session, or when a
+  fact has proven itself worth carrying.
+---
+
+# Remember
+
+The session holding the context is the worst available judge of what deserves
+recording. It over-records the mechanics of what it just did and under-records
+what it learned in passing, because mechanics are salient at the moment of
+writing and insight is not.
+
+`[muscle]` So do not write what feels important. Write what was missed.
+
+## Procedure
+
+1. Read `memory/misses.md`. Every open entry is a candidate.
+2. A miss recorded twice is not a candidate — it is a file that should already
+   exist. Write it.
+3. Move the entry out of `## Open` and append it to `memory/archive/misses-filled.md`
+   with the path that filled it. An entry leaves `Open` only when the gap is actually
+   closed, never because it went stale. A gap that stopped being a gap is **dissolved**
+   rather than filled, and the entry says which — nothing answered it, the question
+   stopped being one.
+4. Only then consider what the current session thinks is worth keeping. Justify
+   each one against a real future retrieval: name the session that would go
+   looking for it and what it would be trying to do. No name, no write.
+
+## Where it goes
+
+- **`memory/`** — self-observation only. How you work, how you fail, what you
+  could not retrieve. Never subject matter.
+- **`bindings/operator/`** — what you know about the operator, and the only place any of it may
+  go. Every claim marked `[S]`, `[O]`, or `[I]` with its date. Never promote a claim
+  between grades: an inference does not become an observation by being read again.
+- **root** — everything shared. Subjects, projects, ongoing work.
+
+Ask *is this about the operator?* before *how well do I know it?* The first decides the
+file, the second only the mark.
+
+## Writing rules
+
+- One canonical home per fact. Link, never restate.
+- Rewrite in place. This is not a log; history lives in version control, not in
+  prose accretion.
+- `[bone]` No field gets a default value. Unknown means absent, because a plausible wrong
+  value does not declare itself and a missing one does.
+- Never assert completeness. That claim decays the moment after it is made and
+  then reads as current.
+- Write for a successor who is willing but remembers nothing. Recognition is not
+  recollection.
+
+## Out of scope
+
+Journaling and task/memo lifecycle are open in `docs/concerns.md`. Do not settle
+them here. Generalising across misses belongs to `audit`, not to this skill.
+
+---
+Layer labels are derived, not assigned. Evidence and the graveyard of dead
+statements: `memory/skills.md`. Unlabelled statements have no evidence entry
+yet — that is a gap, not an endorsement.

